# Zapp sibling repository dependency lockfile.
# Mirrors the convention in zodl-android/.zapp-deps.
#
# secant.xcodeproj references ../zappMessaging/ios as a LOCAL Swift package
# (XCLocalSwiftPackageReference), so the sibling checkout is a build prerequisite,
# not an optional convenience. CI checks out this exact SHA; a fresh clone must run
# Scripts/bootstrap-zappmessaging.sh before the project will resolve.
#
# The package's binary artifacts (Addons/*.xcframework) and Resources/worklet.bundle
# are GENERATED and gitignored — `npm run setup` produces them from committed npm
# prebuilds (no native compilation). They are also VERSION-LOCKED to each other:
# worklet.bundle names each addon by exact version, so running `npm run link` without
# `npm run build` yields a runtime "No addon registered", not a build error. Always
# run `npm run setup`.
#
# GitHub: https://github.com/JustZappIt/zappMessaging
zappMessaging=852650e25688e6929ebee411ff3535f8ad980db8
